  "comment": "There is not much to be changed in ENUM.CONF. However, you need to make sure that there are the following entries: search =&gt; e164.arpa search =&gt; e164.org search =&gt; e164.or.id This way, we can ensure that the information contained in ENUM e164.arpa, e164.org and e164.or.id will be recognized by Asterisk. See Also VoIP Cookbook: Building your own Telecommunication Infrastructure VoIP Cookbook:",
